<title>FRANCE: Sagem denies in deal for Valeo stake.</title>
<headline>Sagem denies in deal for Valeo stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French electronics firm Sagem denied in a statement on Tuesday it had agreed to take a stake in car parts maker Valeo.</p>
<p>&quot;Although Groupe Sagem confirms, as it has done in the past, that it has had talks with Valeo to cooperate on an electronic car, it formally denies it has concluded an agreement to take an eventual stake in this company,&quot; the Sagem statement said.</p>
</text>
